      {
        "id": "textbook-motivation",
        "moduleId": "why-multi-queue",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "教材：多队列调度的由来",
        "markdown": "单队列多处理器调度把所有可运行工作放在同一个队列里，多个 CPU 必须共享同一份队列结构。教材正是用这种共享带来的问题引出多队列方案：由于单队列调度程序的这些问题，一些系统改为每个 CPU 一个队列，称为多队列多处理器调度（Multi-Queue Multiprocessor Scheduling，MQMS）。\n\n因此，MQMS 的出发点不是把队列数量变多，而是用队列的分片消除多个 CPU 之间的共享与同步。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-98b367ee24452fe791591fee",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000144"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
                "操作系统导论",
                "多队列调度"
              ],
              "lineStart": 2840,
              "lineEnd": 2905,
              "assetRefs": [
                "parts/part-0001/images/59bdb6e1d55436159f571db4e117f030ed7b20dd30eb18b585d6b3b696a37847.jpg",
                "parts/part-0001/images/ad131594a7b4eaf3f3a9d572b1553e330531839684379bc7fd05875e52ec8669.jpg",
                "parts/part-0001/images/60d3a6646532c7ed1e90322d1bad42f261ab1b11c03010edc5b8db37b3dd3f95.jpg",
